{"id":"barzillai","name":"Barzillai","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:barzillai"],"types":[{"type":"person","from":"UBS: Names of People"}],"standing":"single-index","indexes":["nave"],"thin":false,"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Barzillai","text":"Of iron. (1.) A Meholathite, the father of Adriel (2 Sam. 21:8). (2.) A Gileadite of Rogelim who was distinguished for his loyalty to David. He liberally provided for the king’s followers (2 Sam. 17:27). David on his death-bed, remembering his kindness, commended Barzillai’s children to the care of Solomon (1 Kings 2:7). (3.) A priest who married a daughter of the preceding (Ezra 2:61)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H1271","lemma":"בַּרְזִלַּי","xlit":"Barzillay","gloss":"Barzillai, the name of three Israelites","kjv":"Barzillai","count":10,"share":0.63},{"strong":"H4428","lemma":"מֶלֶךְ","xlit":"melek","gloss":"a king","kjv":"king, royal","count":10,"share":0.63},{"strong":"H1323","lemma":"בַּת","xlit":"bath","gloss":"a daughter","kjv":"apple, branch, company, daughter","count":3,"share":0.19},{"strong":"H2896","lemma":"טוֹב","xlit":"ṭôwb","gloss":"good in the widest sense","kjv":"beautiful, best, better, bountiful","count":3,"share":0.19},{"strong":"H8141","lemma":"שָׁנֶה","xlit":"shâneh","gloss":"a year","kjv":"whole age, long, old, year","count":3,"share":0.19},{"strong":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","xlit":"bên","gloss":"a son , in the widest sense , etc.)","kjv":"afflicted, age, ite, ed one","count":7,"share":0.44}],"verses":["2Sam.17.27","2Sam.19.31","2Sam.19.32","2Sam.19.33","2Sam.19.34","2Sam.19.39","2Sam.21.8","1Kgs.2.7","Ezra.2.61","Neh.7.63","2Sam.17.28","2Sam.17.29","2Sam.19.35","2Sam.19.36","2Sam.19.37","2Sam.19.38"],"witnesses":["n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n"],"agreed":0,"broader":[{"id":"david","kind":"overlaps","shared":14,"coverage":0.88,"of":16,"n":820}],"narrower":[],"related":[{"id":"mahanaim","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.115,"w